              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "WC-HUB-NPC01_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "This news is grave indeed. I had not expected Malistaire to find those Death Artifacts so quickly. Our time is shorter than I expected.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Ambrose.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/MerleAmbrose_QST_10.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 38168,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "WC-HUB-NPC01_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Dworgyn will require a book. The Dark Grimoire. It has some spells that he will need. Normally I don't like these spells being used. You can see why when you look at what Malistaire is doing with this knowledge.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Ambrose.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/MerleAmbrose_QST_11.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 38168,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "WC-HUB-NPC01_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Go to Nightside, near where Mortis stands. There you will be contacted by a Scarecrow.  He will give you the Dark Grimoire. After that is done, take it immediately to Dworgyn. Go quickly!",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Ambrose.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/MerleAmbrose_QST_12.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 38168,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
